# Construct a Cosmic Cube: whenever you draw your second card each turn, create a 2/1 black Villain token with menace and put a plan
# counter on it (CR 120.3, 122.1); when the seventh plan counter is put on it, sacrifice it, and when you do, you control target
# opponent during their next turn (CR 701.21a, 603.12, 723.1). Bot1 draws its second card in each of its turns 1, 3, 5, 7, 9, 11 and
# 13 with Consider (turn 1 has no draw step, so both draws are Considers), making a token each: after the sixth (turn 11) the Cube
# is still there and nobody controls Bot2; the seventh (turn 13) sacrifices it, and on turn 14 Bot2 is controlled by Bot1.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Mox Sapphire
Construct a Cosmic Cube
Consider
Consider x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x30

